<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong>Past versions of the page are redeable.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Weird beings from a different dimension having their own version of the foundation.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> : This SCP is an anomalous version of the foundation, composed of beings that decompose to carbon after being killed and have an inpossible to decode language. They have one site, a ship, a submarine and an satellite. They contain regular wildlife instead of anomalies. The Foundation, after multiple terminations, explorations, and conflicts, the foundation establish contact and realize they are talking to themselves from a different dimension.They eventually agree on cooperation. The SCP ends with a proposal to merge the two foundations.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> :The Foundation is confronted with themselves.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>:This is going to be very long if it gets greenlit.</p>

